## Context
SYNC.md §Mechanics, carried by no ticket until now (review-implementation.md
§5.4): five drivers hardcode ZOTEUS_SEARCH_BACKEND (query.py,
run_build.py:87, run_serve.py, run_serve2.py, and the recorded env in
results/json-baseline/emit.py — Copilot caught run_build missing from the
enumeration);
upstream's knob is ZOTEUS_INDEX_BACKEND=auto|sqlite|memory. Until the rename
lands, any re-measurement silently measures `auto` and reports whatever the
flag said. One line per driver. Precondition for X2 and X4 re-measurement
(0025).

## Exit criteria
- [x] all five drivers set ZOTEUS_INDEX_BACKEND explicitly ("memory" is the JSON backend's upstream name; --backend refuses values outside sqlite|memory since v1.7.3 config would warn-and-default a stale value to auto)
- [x] each driver's recorded provenance names the env var it set (the env dict lands in each driver's output record; emit.py names it directly)
